{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pants Runner: Glass Coin Chase is a fast-paced, third-person endless runner where your character, wearing only pants, embarks on a dangerous adventure to collect crystal coins! Your mission is simple but challenging: run as far as you can, collect glass coins, and avoid deadly rocks that instantly end your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc3 CORE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUNNING AND SURVIVAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly accelerating pace - the longer you run, the faster the game becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly obstacles - rocks instantly kill your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respawn from scratch - after death, the game starts from the starting point.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECTION SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glass coins - the main collectible resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnet - a temporary booster that attracts coins to your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive difficulty - the more coins collected, the higher the speed and difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 PROGRESS SYSTEMS: RECORDS AND ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievement System: 3 unique achievements for various feats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival for a certain amount of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting a specific number of coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using magnets a certain number of times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching specific speed thresholds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressive rewards - the longer you play, the more achievements you unlock.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Play 1 minute in row","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3628000/955c03c74da5cd3f121772de84422f0dc54bdebf.jpg"},{"name":"Play 2 minutes","pa